{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14143","headline":"成都元十八侍御 · 戎昱","name":"成都元十八侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不见元生已数朝，浣花溪路去菲遥。\n客舍早知浑寂寞，交情岂谓更萧条。\n空有寸心思会面，恨无单酌遣相邀。\n骅骢幸自能驰骤，何惜挥鞭过柞桥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}